{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>ואני אקשה.</b> Once he acted wickedly and brazenly defied Me, and it is revealed before Me that the nations find no composure of spirit to set their whole heart to repent — it is better that his heart harden, so as to multiply My signs through him, and that you recognize My might. And so is the way of the Holy One, blessed be He: He brings punishment upon the nations so that Israel hear and fear, as it says: ״I have cut off nations; their corners are desolate… I said: Only fear Me, take correction״ (Zephaniah 3). Yet even so, in the first five plagues it is not said וַיְחַזֵּק ה׳ אֶת לֵב פַּרְעֹה, but rather וַיֶּחֱזַק לֵב פַּרְעֹה (Tanchuma)."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:50:58.344353052Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}